sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff as Help Desk Staff
    participant C as StaffTicketController
    participant S as TicketServiceImpl
    participant Sub as TicketEventSubject
    participant A as AuditLogObserver
    participant N as StaffNotificationObserver
    participant St as StudentNotificationObserver

    Staff->>C: Mark ticket RESOLVED
    C->>S: updateStatus(ticketId, "RESOLVED", staff)
    S->>S: validate transition, set status, set resolvedAt
    S->>Sub: notifyObservers(STATUS_CHANGED event)
    Sub->>A: update(event)
    A->>A: write audit log TICKET_STATUS_RESOLVED
    Sub->>N: update(event)
    N-->>N: ignore (no staff reaction)
    Sub->>St: update(event)
    St->>St: save bell notification for the student
    St->>St: send e-mail to the student (async)
    Sub-->>S: return
    S-->>C: updated ticket
    C-->>Staff: redirect to ticket page
